OL,3,GUK five day outlook
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled throughout, with heavy,
OL,7,Fthundery showers in many areas on
OL,8,FSunday. Monday will be somewhat drier,
OL,9,Fespecially later, before showers
OL,10,Freturn Tuesday. Often windy near
OL,11,Fcoasts, with temperatures around
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
